{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22341","headline":"白发 · 白居易","name":"白发","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白发知时节，闇与我有期。\n今朝日阳裹，梳落数茎丝。\n家人不惯见，悯默爲我悲。\n我云何足怪，此意尔不知。\n凡人年三十，外壮中已衰。\n但思寝食味，已减二十时。\n况我今四十，本来形貌羸。\n书魔昏两眼，酒病沈四肢。\n亲爱日零落，在者仍别离。\n身心久如此，白发生已迟。\n由来生老死，三病长相随。\n除却念无生，人间无药治。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}